   Full text: `LICENSES/Bitstream-Vera.txt` (also bundled in the
   published crate at `assets/LICENSE-DejaVu`).

2. Noto Sans JP Regular (`crates/slate-text/assets/NotoSansJP-Regular.otf`)
   SIL Open Font License 1.1.
   Copyright (c) Google Inc., with Reserved Font Name "Noto".
   Full text: `LICENSES/OFL-1.1.txt` (also bundled in the published
