Downstream binary distributions that re-ship `slate-text` (directly or
via `slate-framework`) MUST preserve these attributions. The license
files inside `crates/slate-text/assets/` are included in the published
crate package; depending crates can surface them by reading
`slate_text::DEJAVU_SANS_LICENSE` and `slate_text::NOTO_SANS_JP_LICENSE`
at runtime, or by copying the asset files into their distribution.

